From 8700b1c2b168ebd88b8660551d228fa88734992c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:57:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: leds: Describe first-generation Qualcomm torch
 LEDs

Describe the PM8226 and PM8941 peripheral with its distinct register
layout, shared torch current control and optional supply. Preserve the
compatible and child layout used by the existing Fx0 integration.

Ordinary binding/example validation passes on the current LED maintainer
base. Prepared with OpenAI Codex assistance; human review and DCO
pending.
---
 MAINTAINERS | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index b9e3b0c17127..50a4d9c77d2b 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -23122,6 +23122,12 @@ F:	drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_pas.h
 F:	drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_pas_tee.c
 F:	include/linux/firmware/qcom/qcom_pas.h
 
+QUALCOMM PM8941 TORCH LED DRIVER
+M:	Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
+L:	linux-leds@vger.kernel.org
+S:	Maintained
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/leds/qcom,pm8941-flash-led.yaml
+
 QUALCOMM SMB CHARGER DRIVER
 M:	Casey Connolly <casey.connolly@linaro.org>
 L:	linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org
